bounty-item-nuclear-fuel = Nuclear fuel rods
bounty-description-nuclear-fuel = Our reactor has ran out of fuel, and we are unable to manufacture new rods! Please, send a replacement ASAP, we're running out of pow- ERROR SIGNAL lost

bounty-item-blood-vial = Blood vials
bounty-description-blood-vial = We urgently require blood for uhh... blood transfusions. And our equipment only accepts blood in special vials. Nothing illegal going on here. Please do not investigate us.

bounty-item-magic-ink = Magical ink
bounty-description-magic-ink = We need some magical ink for our research, but our local demonologist was dragged into the depths of hell. If you know someone who can assist, we'll compensate greatly. Do not let security find out or we're all going behind bars for life!

bounty-item-slime-extract = Any slime extract
bounty-description-slime-extract = Slimes ate our xenobiologist, and we urgently need new slime extracts. It probably needs a specific color, but I have no idea how any of this works, so it's probably fine?

bounty-item-insuls = Insulated gloves
bounty-description-insuls = We are taking over this station, and you're gonna help us. Greytide worldwide!

bounty-item-ranching-hen = Any hen
bounty-description-ranching-hen = The clown fed our chikens to the singularity engine, and now we only have roosters, but no hens. Please send us any hen, and make sure it's alive.

bounty-item-ranching-rooster = Any rooster
bounty-description-ranching-rooster = A heretic has sacrificed all our roosters, so now we can't get any fertilized eggs. Please ship us a new rooster, and make sure it's not dead.
